  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of MYNSAM 2.0 Framework Programme with Ministry of Ministry of Industry, Business and Financial Affairs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An external consultant is needed to appraise the four-year Framework Programme (FP) under the Ministry of Industry, Business and Financial Affairs, developed under the Strategic Sector Cooperation (SSC) guidelines for MYNSAM 2.0. The FP includes the experience from the existing SSC projects implemented by the Danish Maritime Authority (DMA) and the Danish Patent and Trademark Office (DKPTO) in Brazil, India, China, Indonesia, Ghana and Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
